│ procedures", "abstract": "The purpose of this study was to determine if 4 mg of ondansetron and 12.5 mg of           │
│ dolasetron were equally effective in preventing postoperative nausea and vomiting (PONV) in patients undergoing      │
│ gynecological procedures. While the overall incidence of PONV appears to be 25% to 35%, the incidence among this     │
