(laparoscopic cholecystectomy, gynecological surgery, thyroidectomy, tonsillectomy, etc.).\n\nEXCLUDED (23 studies):    
Exclusion reasons included:\n- Non-RCT design (reviews, case reports, meta-analyses): Studies 126, 140, 156, 168, 174,  
