│ adverse effects, more analgesia, and a deeper sedation, which is easily reversed with physostigmine at the end of    │
│ anaesthesia."}, {"study_index": 796, "title": "Droperidol, alizapride and metoclopramide in the prevention and       │
│ treatment of post-operative emetic sequelae", "abstract": "Women (182) undergoing elective orthopaedic surgery under │
