│ patients.search.ebscohost.com"}, {"study_index": 798, "title": "Use of dexamethasone on the prophylaxis of nausea    │
│ and vomiting after tympanomastoid surgery", "abstract": "OBJECTIVE The aim of this study was to evaluate the         │
