│ droperidol and dexamethasone in reducing the incidence of PONV in patients with a high risk of developing PONV       │
│ according to the Apfel score.Material and methods This was a comparative, prospective, randomised, double blind      │
│ study. After written informed consent, patients scheduled for otorhinolaryngology or visceral surgery under          │
│ standardised general anaesthesia were randomly assigned to receive a capsule of oral aprepitant 40 mg or a capsule   │
