│ 0.3 mg iv was more effective than palonosetron 0.075 mg and ondansetron 8 mg in the early postoperative period, but  │
│ there was no significant difference in the overall incidence of nausea suffered.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov"}]}'}.              │
